WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.900
<i>They're out on an inspection today.</i>

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:11.710
Your Highness.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:12.370
Hm?

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.860
Would you like red bean pancake?

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.850
Thank you, I would.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.190
I'll take one.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.170
What's wrong, Your Highness?!

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:43.430
Th-There's something doughy inside.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.650
Oh, you won.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:50.680
Huh?

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:54.560
This shop randomly adds rice flour 
balls to some of the pancakes.

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.200
You've got good luck, Your Highness.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.120
You have some, too, Mullin.

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:04.940
Huh?

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.470
I'll share some of my luck with you.

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:10.090
Thanks!

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.360
<i>Nice and peaceful, as always.</i>

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:55.740
Astaroth-sama!

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.530
Astaroth-sama!

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.340
Sargatanas-sama!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.200
We can't find Astaroth-sama!

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.540
Again?

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.750
We're sorry...

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.750
We can never find him when we go looking...

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.280
It's fine. He's the one at fault.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.820
I'll go get him.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:24.510
<b>Separated by One Can of Coffee.</b>

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.680
I had fun again today.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:32.980
I love going on dates with you.

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:34.680
You do?

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:36.360
I had fun, too.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.140
Hey, Astaroth-sama...

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.320
I want to stay with you longer.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:46.780
You're so silly.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.320
Then how about we...

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.760
You're coming back with me.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.180
Sacchan! Time out! Uncle, uncle, uncle!

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:03.930
I can walk on my own, you know.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:05.890
I don't want to go back.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.920
I don't want to work.

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:10.030
Oh, I know. How about we take a small break?

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.140
Let's go to Starlucks.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:12.350
We're not going anywhere.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.990
Hey, let's get some tea.

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:15.110
One cup of tea.

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:17.820
We can head back after that.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:20.480
You can drink tea in the office.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.030
No! I want to drink tea out somewhere!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.980
I can't do work without 
something to change it up!

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.200
Huh?

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.740
You've already done enough other stuff!

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:37.970
<i>Sacchan gave in a little bit, anyway.</i>

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.800
I wanted Starlucks.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:43.160
You'd just stay there if we went.

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:47.010
You already have trouble coming 
back to work, once you run off.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:51.880
<i>She says that, but in reality, 
she didn't know what to order at Starlucks.</i>

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:57.480
<i>Maybe an iced double shot choco-banana 
latte with vanilla whipped cream?</i>

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:00.050
We're heading back right after 
you drink whatever you get.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:00.880
Right.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.750
What do you want?

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.740
I'm fine.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.450
Don't be like that.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.050
It's my thanks to you for coming to get me.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:12.410
I'm the one who put the money in the machine.

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.050
<i>Darn it...</i>

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.780
<i>The atmosphere in this park is awkward.</i>

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:26.130
<i>There're couples everywhere.</i>

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:31.600
<i>Youngsters nowadays 
don't have any shame.</i>

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.970
Glad the weather is nice today.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.690
I know.

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:39.140
How about we rest for a second?

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.060
Sounds good.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:47.290
<i>Elders, I would appreciate it if you 
said a word to all these youngsters.</i>

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:51.740
<i>What's wrong with being close?</i>

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:54.920
Sorry, it's kind of awkward here, huh?

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.820
N-No, it's fine.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:03.340
I can always depend on Sacchan 
not to get caught up in the mood.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:09.640
<i>I can never let loose and go with the flow.</i>

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.250
<i>Wait? Why would I go with the flow here?</i>

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:14.560
<i>What am I saying?</i>

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:18.440
<b>Intensity</b>

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:17.900
It's not like I <i>want</i>
to let loose right now!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:21.330
Sorry, are you mad?

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:28.860
<i>It's amazing they can lean 
on each other like that.</i>

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:35.580
<i>I can't even imagine myself filling 
the space of this one coffee can.</i>

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.810
<i>This can represents the distance</i>

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:41.550
<i>between one's personal space and another's.</i>

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:45.300
<i>What type of relationship would you 
have to be in to enter another's space?</i>

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:48.740
<i>Couples are really something.</i>

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:51.040
<i>I truly respect all the couples out there,</i>

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:54.470
<i>and every mother and father.</i>

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.430
Hey, Sacchan! 
You're actually mad, aren't you?!

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:00.360
<i>Hold on a second...</i>

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:01.900
<i>Why am I talking about getting closer?</i>

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.450
<i>Do I want to get closer to someone?</i>

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:06.860
<i>But with who?</i>

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:08.820
<i>With this joker?</i>

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:13.200
<b>Joker</b>

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.200
<i>Love has blossomed.</i>

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:14.710
<i>No way! No way! No way!</i>

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:17.160
<i>Not at all! Not possible! Impossible!</i>

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.950
Uncle, uncle, uncle!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:20.830
What was that?

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:26.950
<i>I'm just his assistant.</i>

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:30.340
<i>I'm just forced to watch this loser.</i>

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.450
<i>I mean I did make those pressed flowers,</i>

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:35.300
<i>but that was just because the 
flowers I got were so pretty...</i>

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:36.580
<i>I mean...</i>

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:40.640
<i>I-I don't like him...</i>

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.690
<i>Like...</i>

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:48.280
<i>She's upset she even said the word "like."</i>

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.320
<i>I don't like him, do I?</i>

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:57.630
<i>My ideal is a gentle soul 
like Fluffy Whiskers.</i>

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:59.540
<i>And in comparison, he...</i>

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:01.650
<i>doesn't do his work,</i>

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.130
<i>messes around with too many women,</i>

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:05.070
<i>and doesn't handle money properly.</i>

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:07.290
<i>He's completely worthless.</i>

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:12.360
<i>He's completely worthless, 
and that's putting it lightly.</i>

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.460
<i>She calmed down a bit.</i>

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:23.740
Are you done drinking?

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.910
Oh, you noticed?

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.270
Let's head back.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:28.150
What?!

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:29.760
I don't want to do work!

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:31.700
I want to do anything but work!

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:35.790
God wants me to fly around the world!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.120
I don't think so.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.660
You're had enough, right?

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.580
Let's go.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:46.140
Thank you, Sacchan.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.290
For what?

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.880
I'm not really doing my job,

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.010
and still, you take care of me.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:56.180
I really like you, Sacchan.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.790
<i>Here we go again.</i>

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.800
Well, you always find me.

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:07.190
I like you, Sacchan.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:15.200
<i>I know that this guy says things like 
that to any girl, just to be nice.</i>

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:18.460
<i>I know that...</i>

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:24.870
I really don't want to do any work.

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:29.010
Don't touch me for no reason.

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.840
Try to get me in the working mood.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.560
I'll sue you for sexual harassment.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.550
Sorry, please don't.

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:42.120
<i>I thought she'd push me off,</i>

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:45.040
<i>but Sacchan always remains calm.</i>

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.110
<i>Makes me feel better.</i>

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:54.990
Why are you making that face?!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:57.340
Oh, sorry! I didn't think 
you'd be that upset!

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:58.380
I'm really sorry!

00:09:58.380 --> 00:09:59.520
Let's head back!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.980
<i>My one coffee can separating us...</i>

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:17.700
I'm exhausted again.

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:42.550
<i>Stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid!</i>

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:44.450
<i>I'm so stupid!</i>

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:47.500
<i>Why would I think about that...</i>

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.550
Astaroth-sama!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.420
Astaroth-sama!

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:03.530
Sorry, Sargatanas-sama, Astaroth-sama is...

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:06.220
Again?

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.300
Sorry for always making you do this...

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:11.690
I'll be right back.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.400
What's wrong?

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:17.610
It's just that...

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:22.080
Sargatanas-sama seemed kind of happy.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.020
Huh? That can't be.

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:24.950
Huh?

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:46.560
<i>It's cold...</i>

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:06.350
<i>I'm still cold...</i>

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.620
<i>Why?</i>

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.480
<i>A cold front.</i>

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:21.050
<b>Your Scent on a Cold Day.</b>

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.840
Oh, Your Highness.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.160
Good morning.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.760
It's quite cold today.

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:30.260
Your Highness?

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:36.430
Do I have to go to work, no matter what?

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:37.280
Huh?

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:41.390
Do you think everyone might
take the day off to eat mandarins

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:42.760
under a heated blanket?

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:43.690
What?

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.010
<i>She doesn't want to go out.</i>

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:49.490
I'm not good with the cold.

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:52.640
<i>The heater is on in the hallway...</i>

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.010
<i>It's not that cold.</i>

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:56.410
Oh, I know.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.430
Have a pocket warmer.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:04.480
But don't you need to use it?

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.630
I'm fine.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:09.100
I've stuck them on my clothes.

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:12.420
<i>Mullin's like a mother!</i>

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.560
<i>She's really down.</i>

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:22.730
<i>I need to talk about something 
to cheer her up.</i>

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:29.130
Your Highness, aren't there lots of 
fluffy animals that live in the cold?

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:32.290
You should think about the 
fluffiness and cheer up!

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:33.280
Right?

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:35.250
Yeah.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.470
There're seals and polar bears.

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:39.930
Penguins chicks are fluffy, too.

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:42.270
There're ermines, as well.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:46.160
Have you heard of arctic hares?

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:47.800
Oh, I have!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.010
They're round and cute, right?

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:56.660
When arctic hares stand 
up they completely change.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.230
Legs

00:13:58.430 --> 00:13:59.860
That's all I wanted to tell you.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.420
<i>How is he supposed
to use that information?</i>

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:08.900
Sorry, it seems the heater is broken.

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:11.180
I got a space heater.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:13.120
Hold on just a minute longer.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.780
Your Highness, would you like 
some plum kelp tea or amazake?

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:19.610
I'll have some of the tea.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:21.420
We'll get a blanket, too.

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:25.380
Thank you, Gusion, Otis.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.010
<i>First time they were called.</i>

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.550
<b>Assistant
Otis</b>

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.550
<b>Assistant
Gusion</b>

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.480
<i>What was that sneeze just now?</i>

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.950
<i>It was so cute!</i>

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:41.180
<i>Wait...</i>

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:42.930
Um, are you okay?

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.320
Do you need to go to the infirmary?

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.190
No, I'm fine.

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.430
<i>We have a meeting next, too.</i>

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:51.540
What should I do...

00:14:56.080 --> 00:15:00.170
Um, maybe you're so cold because 
you're exposing so much skin...

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.480
<i>Walking to the meeting room.</i>

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:13.300
Actually, I did get some 
winter clothing made.

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:16.490
You should put that on.

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:19.430
We should stop by your room 
before we head to the meeting.

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:23.400
But, Bell, it'd be a shame 
if you wrap up your boobs!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.110
Where did you slink in from?!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:28.520
I'll appear wherever Bell is!

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:32.220
I'm worried about how 
Her Highness is feeling, though.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:34.410
It'd be better if she put 
on her winter uniform.

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:39.120
I don't like my winter clothing because 
it kind of constricts my chest...

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.190
Shh, Bell!

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:42.440
If Sacchan hears you...

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:45.540
I wouldn't do anything bad to a superior.

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:48.060
I'm technically your superior, too.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.740
Do I look good?

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:07.570
<i>You know...</i>

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.660
<i>Just covering them up 
doesn't change anything!</i>

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:13.410
I-It looks good on you.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.620
You're not even looking.

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:18.250
This again... Blah.

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:21.200
<i>They're just too massive.</i>

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.920
You look different than you 
usually do, which is nice.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:29.170
And you know, they say women 
shouldn't get too cold.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:33.130
I wouldn't mind if you were 
in these clothes all the time.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.540
Really?!

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:41.720
Fluffy!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:45.650
Come on, you can't leave the room.

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:47.380
<i>I'm glad.</i>

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.520
<i>It looks like she's doing 
better, now that she's warmer.</i>

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:51.440
What's wrong?!

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:55.360
Th-The fluffiness...

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:56.800
Huh?

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:03.800
The fluffiness that I could feel 
directly on my chest before...

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:05.960
I can't get that same feeling anymore!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:09.440
I knew I didn't need 
anything covering my chest!

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.310
It was more functional that way!

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:13.920
<i>Ad-neesan designed it perfectly.</i>

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:17.780
Well, you shouldn't be so 
depressed for this meeting.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:26.700
Why do we have to pass by the courtyard 
just to get to the meeting room?

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:28.860
Normally, it feels pretty 
good to do so, but...

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.320
What are you doing, Molech-san?

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:34.780
Snowman!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:35.880
Right.

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.260
<i>What?</i>

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.870
Dantalion!

00:17:40.360 --> 00:17:42.080
How did this happen to you?!

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:48.150
I was in my room for a while reading books,

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:52.750
so I thought it'd be nice
to get some fresh air, but...

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:55.470
this cold front came...

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:58.320
Then, just go back to your room!

00:17:58.320 --> 00:17:59.800
I didn't know when to stop reading...

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:03.590
Dantalion always finishes
what he sets his mind to!

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:05.140
No, you should have stopped him!

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.920
And I'm Dantalion's friend,

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.190
so I stayed at his side this whole time!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.860
Then you should have stopped him!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:15.240
What are you doing?!

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:20.730
My love, Dantalion, was thousands 
of times more beautiful, sublime,

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:23.680
and wonderful as a statue of ice!

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:26.540
You should have stopped him, too!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.940
Let's hurry, Your Highness.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:37.270
It'll be warm in the meeting room.

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:37.920
Yeah.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.100
Maybe we should get you to 
the infirmary, after all.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.620
No, I'm fine.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.860
I think I'm just allergic 
to the extreme cold.

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:54.770
I hate the cold.

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:03.340
Your Highness, could you look down a second?

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:09.300
Sorry about this.

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:21.510
How's that?

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:29.900
It's warm.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.610
But then you'll be cold!

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:41.940
No, I handle the cold well, 
and I have the warmers.

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:43.660
Let's go.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:48.160
<i>I touched her hair a little bit.</i>

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:50.870
Thank you...

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.070
It's his...

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:12.730
Your Highness, what's the matter?

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:13.970
N-Nothing!

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:16.690
Just... You know...

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.280
I feel better now.

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:25.400
<i>It smells like Mullin...</i>

00:20:29.610 --> 00:20:34.350
<i>Maybe it wasn't so bad 
for it to be cold today.</i>

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:59.740
So regarding the tourism proposal for 
the frozen hell that is Cocyutus...

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:03.110
<i>Her Highness's face is red...</i>

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:06.900
<i>Your Highness, did you catch a cold?</i>

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:10.130
I'm not sniffing anything!

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:10.830
Huh?

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:50.620
<i>The next day, after the cold front had passed.</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:52.800
Good morning.

00:22:53.320 --> 00:22:55.570
The weather's nice outside.

00:22:57.470 --> 00:22:58.270
Your Highness?

00:22:59.650 --> 00:23:05.620
It is nice out, b-but I'm still a bit cold...

00:23:05.620 --> 00:23:06.790
Yeah...

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:14.620
Huh?

00:23:16.440 --> 00:23:19.280
There's nothing stuck in your hair.

00:23:19.280 --> 00:23:20.080
That's not what I want!

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:20.710
Huh?

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:24.480
I, uh...

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:29.170
It's nothing!

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:31.280
What?

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Gocchin in Merryland.</b>

00:23:36.120 --> 00:23:37.970
Please look forward to next time.
